OL,3,GNEWSALorry training firm 'riding out'
OL,4,Arecord diesel price
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecord-breaking fuel prices have left a
OL,7,Ffirm teaching people to drive lorries
OL,8,Fand buses having to "ride out" the
OL,9,Frising cost of filling up its vehicles.
OL,11,FThe average price of diesel in the UK
OL,12,Fhit an all-time high this week at
OL,13,F199.33p a litre, according to the RAC
OL,14,Fmotoring organisation.
OL,16,FPrices have been steadily rising since
OL,17,Fthe US-Israel war with Iran began in
OL,18,FFebruary. Petrol has also risen to
OL,19,F174.23p a litre.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
