OL,3,GNEWSALorry training firm 'riding out'
OL,4,Arecord diesel price
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteve Dulson, managing director of
OL,7,FShropshire-based Dulson Training, said
OL,8,Fit was costing hundreds of pounds more
OL,9,Fto fill up each lorry compared with
OL,10,F2025 prices.
